«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  BernoulliAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 2; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 2 ≠ THEN "BernoulliAll: needs 2 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → pv Xv « pv 0 + Xv 0 + → p X « 'IFTE(X<0;0;IFTE(X<1;1-p;1))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(ABS(X)<0.5;1-p;IFTE(ABS(X-1)<0.5;p;0))' →Num "PDF" →Tag '1-Kc' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'p' →Num "μ" →Tag '√(p*(1-p))' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE pv Xv 2 →List Drop » »
»
